          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card__image">
          <img
            src="/images/services/uv-printing.jpg"
            alt="УФ-печать"
          >

          <div class="service-card__placeholder">
            Место для фотографии УФ-печати
